                 unit word, not just the symbol. "IPS DC-DC DATALOGGER Voltage" + "V" was rendering
                 "Voltage V"; "Lamp Current" + "mA" -> "Current mA". metricUnitSuffix() now knows unit
                 synonyms (V<->
    Volt/Voltage, mA<->
        Current, ohm<->
            Resistance, ...) and suppresses on a
            token boundary. Symbol forms ("RG mA","DG V","(V)") still handled. Owner: "Voltage V".
            1.0.55.159 - THE NUMBERS double-unit: harden the remaining metric+unit cell. The main numbers
