            1.0.55.158 - THE NUMBERS double-unit fix, merged. RDPMS metric names already carry their unit
            ("RG mA","DG V","VTC TFC O/P(V)"), so appending z.unit rendered "RG mA mA" /
            "VTC TFC O/P(V) V". Added metricUnitSuffix() (token-boundary de-dup, handles trailing
