            1.0.55.157 - PM ANALYSIS compact card: "LOAD ANALYSIS" now goes through the same-origin
            /AiChat/PmOpsV4 proxy as the full view. It was still calling the v4 host directly
            from the browser, which cannot work from an https page (mixed content) and cannot
            reach an internal address from a client machine either -- the button always ended
            at "endpoint unreachable". Same fetch, same failure text style as the full view.
            1.0.55.156 - PM ANALYSIS gains the Model 4 visuals. The chapter showed state text and a
            CSS dot strip only; Machine A/B cards, Timeline, Measurement trend and Class
            Timeline now render in their own full-width view (#aiPm4View) opened from the
            card's "Full analysis" button. Data comes from GET /AiChat/PmOpsV4 (same
