            min-height while chips sat rows deep. Rebuilt to COMPUTE the packing first and emit the
            lane once, height already known. Sub-rows capped at 8 with a "+N more" marker (PT-1
            alone produced 20+ rows), and chips clamped at the lane edges so a 23:5x alert cannot
