                                                /* ===== AI DIAGNOSTIC VIEW ===== */
                                                /* v1.0.53.2: FRAMELESS design -- drop the boxed modal border/heavy shadow for a soft,
                                                   borderless surface; seamless header (no hard divider), borderless text Back link. */
                                                #aaAlertModal .modal-content {
